---
Preview activation, or activate after confirming the source owner is stopped

Usage: mxr recovery activate [OPTIONS] --expected-workspace <JSON>

Options:
      --source-owner-stopped
      --expected-workspace <JSON>  Owner JSON returned by `mxr recovery status` or its preview
      --confirm
      --format <FORMAT>            [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help                       Print help
